The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code in this repository only: the protocol client, the bot
runner, the loop contract and the tests.

This project talks to Adventure Land (https://adventure.land) and depends on the following, none of
which is distributed here:

  Adventure Land
    https://adventure.land
    The game itself. Game data (data.js) is fetched by npm run fetch-data and is not stored in this
    repository. The game's own terms apply; the server side of the game (kaansoral/adventureland_mongodb)
    is used at run time by the game container, not redistributed here.

  ALClient
    https://github.com/kaansoral/ALClient
    A community protocol client that this implementation was modelled on and read from. No code was
    copied; it carries no licence, so nothing from it is vendored here. Credit is given for the
    reference, not as a licence grant.

  adventureland-container
    https://github.com/DionJones615/adventureland-container
    The game stack image the e2e tests pull (MIT for its own code).

Adventure Land is created and maintained by its authors. This project is not affiliated with them.
